# Testing

Jangan menambah file `tests/test_*.py`. Perluas coverage di inventaris yang sudah ada lewat **OOP**: `class Test*` + method `test_*`. Detail: `docs/testing.md`.

| Domain | File |
|--------|------|
| Pipeline (config → CLI) | `tests/test_suite.py` |
| Crop / ink / symbolic | `tests/test_crop_symbolic.py` |
| Confirm / recrop | `tests/test_crop_confirm.py` |
| Number line / figure | `tests/test_number_line.py` |
| Helper + fake bersama | `tests/helpers.py` |

```text
❌ tests/test_foo.py baru
❌ def test_... level modul
❌ Kasus uji di conftest.py / live Ollama di pytest
✅ class TestFoo + def test_...(self): di file inventaris
✅ Fake/double sebagai class di helpers.py (atau nested)
✅ Hapus method/class = kurangi coverage (tidak ada registry)
```

Domain baru → `class TestNama:` di file terdekat (biasanya `test_suite.py`). Skill: `write-math-grader-tests`.
